' Independently authored Kobrixa example
' Connect a color sensor to input 4. Mode 2 is the EV3 Color mode.
Folder "prjs" "Kobrixa"

Sensor.SetMode(4, 2)
Sensor.Wait(4)
raw = Sensor.ReadRaw(4, 2)
value = raw[0]
LCD.Clear()
LCD.Text(1, 8, 18, 1, "Raw channel 0: " + value) ' 沒有值
LCD.Update()
Program.Delay(1000)
